    <bpmn:process id="W_W2880" name="W2880. Labor-Management Council (LMC) Charter &amp; Joint Governance Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LMC establishment or annual cycle
Frequency: Quarterly LMC meetings
Volume: Per location/entity
Owner: Labor Relations Director
Participants: LR Director, HR, Management Reps, Union Reps
Source: workflow W2880 — Labor-Management Council (LMC) Charter &amp; Joint Governance Operations</bpmn:documentation>
